  {
   "id": "biped-121247@2.6",
   "gameId": "biped-121247",
   "displayName": "Update 2.6",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2024-11-29T16:41:05.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Dear Bipedals.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We are happy to present an update 2.6 for Biped. What was changed:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed an issue with the wrong Pro Level in the Single Player campaign",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed issues with the controller (2 controllers were recognized as 1)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed achievement issue (pass all levels)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Improved Online COOP performance",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Also, we are happy to announce the updated social networks that might help you with your questions about the game and help you communicate with each other (for example in your search for a partner for COOP). You could easily reach us and the community of the game via the Steam forum or the following socials:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "https://x.com/_Biped - Twitter",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "https://www.reddit.com/r/Biped/ - Reddit",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "https://discord.gg/Skwk6bqG5B - DIscord",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "https://www.youtube.com/@metapublishing/ - Youtube channel",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We will be happy to help you out with your questions there.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Biped - connecting people :)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "P.S. Don't forget to wishlist Biped 2 as we plan to have a closed Alpha-test next year: https://store.steampowered.com/app/2560240/Biped_2/",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
