  {
   "id": "biped-121247@2.0",
   "gameId": "biped-121247",
   "displayName": "Update 2.0",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2024-09-13T13:00:42.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hello, adventurers!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "As many of you already know, we're working hard on improving Biped 2 in every way. We've already shared some new mechanics, but today we'll be covering even more changes!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Eliminating Bugs [img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/44983473/91950732ed85f2e43904d67ddb733b91be520146.jpg\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Our team has been carefully collecting feedback on Biped 2, and we're carefully reviewing each and every one of the reviews. The best way for you is to write it in the discussion so that we can easily ask questions and request additional information and data if we can't reproduce the bug on our side (this is usually needed to understand what to fix). Some issues with gameplay mechanics, level geometry, or camera angles were disruptive, and we've paid close attention to every piece of feedback that reported gameplay issues. We're pleased to announce that the game, in its current state, has gained new mechanics and lost quite a few bugs: if you quit playing due to technical issues, now's the time to come back!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "More Puzzles!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/44983473/8f8d7442978aaf975f9eb02d5d21b4f45f6830fb.jpg\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "A game free of bugs and technical issues is great, but we're striving for something truly great! Brand-new puzzles and puzzles have been added to levels 10 through 17. Rotate mirrors, navigate mazes, and balance on platforms! We've even changed the game's ending to give the Bipeds' journey a truly satisfying conclusion. We're confident that the updated seventeenth level will be a memorable finale to your playthrough. And after winning the finale, you'll see global game statistics reflecting all your achievements.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Co-op Mode and Other Improvements",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/44983473/02c10ae12dcd4e8a8aafda85c95ede3f9fe7a069.jpg\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Co-op mode has always been and remains a key feature of Biped 2. We've worked hard to ensure you can play with friends without lag or bugs, and in this patch, we've made a couple more useful upgrades! Direct P2P connections for Steam are now even more reliable, meaning you can focus on solving puzzles instead of worrying about an unsteady connection. We've also listened to feedback and rolled back some changes that weren't working, such as returning more familiar mechanics to level four.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "This is the updated Biped 2, and we hope you enjoy it even more! Play with friends, experience familiar levels in a new light, have fun, and, of course, let us know what you think of the updated game!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
