  {
   "id": "biped-121247@1.2",
   "gameId": "biped-121247",
   "displayName": "Patch 1.2",
   "kind": "hotfix",
   "kindBasis": "inferred",
   "announcedAt": "2020-04-02T02:18:27.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "4/2更新信息 | April 2 v1.2 Patch Notes",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "1. Added controller vibration on/off option",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "2. In online coop, the guest player is now able to keep the progress of coin collection, achievements and unlocked levels",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "3. Various bug fixes",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "---",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "1. 现在可以在选项中开启或关闭手柄震动模式",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "2. 现在online联机模式中，客机玩家能够保留金币、成就和解锁关卡的游戏进度",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "3. 修复部分其他bug",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
